    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "There are many amazing and exciting experiences in our lives that help us "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Recently, I had a wonderful experience and I want to share it with you."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In our school, we have many different activities every week, one of which was a bazaar held a couple of weeks ago and, for me, it was unforgettable. At this bazaar, we sold our "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " things, such as books, toys and so on. But it was more than that. All the money we received was for "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "donation",
            "ref": "v-donation"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and that made the whole event "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In order to "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " attention, our class carefully designed a lucky draw and decided to sell goods in turn. First, my classmate Peter sold a cloth tiger. It symbolizes China’s lucky traditional culture. Then, the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "raisin scones",
            "zh": "提子松饼"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " Alice made were loved by everyone. What an artist! Next, it was my "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Standing in front of everyone in my class, I felt frightened and nervous "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " then Jill came to encourage me. She told me to "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and enjoy it. With her help, I successfully sold many of my interesting storybooks. How fun that was! The bazaar finished quickly. To my surprise, we raised 715 "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "yuan"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " altogether. We all hope the money will be of some help to "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " children in mountainous areas."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "There is no "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " that this "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "precious",
            "ref": "v-precious"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " experience enriched my daily life. I learned that "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " is difficult for anyone who makes the effort."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
